WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:05.420
The one piece manga just made it clear that
Admiral Kizaru is going to be a massive problem

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:06.549
for Luffy.

00:00:06.549 --> 00:00:12.800
Because in this chapter we get to see a glimpse
of the Light man’s incredible powers as

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:19.449
he not only sends Luffy flying, but also easily
destroys this giant robot, and brushes aside

00:00:19.449 --> 00:00:22.560
Jewelry Bonney like she is a bug.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:28.110
On top of all that, the insane former warlord
Kuma is running wild in Mariejois, and in

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:33.760
his first MAJOR ACTION since the time skip,
the Fleet Admiral Akainu is coming to stop

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:34.760
him.

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:38.739
Which honestly I am just as excited about
this because it could mean that Kuma could

00:00:38.739 --> 00:00:44.039
soon share revealing some of the World Governments
darkest secrets to the ONE MARINE who has

00:00:44.039 --> 00:00:48.160
the power and ruthlessness to take out the
world nobles.

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:53.570
And if that wasn’t enough this chapter also
revealed a TRULY MIND-BLOWING secret about

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:54.609
the One Piece treasure.

00:00:54.609 --> 00:01:00.430
That’s because Luffy’s LITERAL HEARTBEAT
appears to have awakened this gigantic ancient

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:05.510
robot, which could be the explanation for
why Roger couldn’t use what he found on

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:11.840
Laugh Tale, why Shanks stole the Nika devil
fruit, and why Shanks is now ready to go after

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:13.060
the One Piece.

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:17.409
But let’s kick things off with the most
heart-pounding action we’ve had in what

00:01:17.409 --> 00:01:19.240
feels like many chapters.

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:25.700
That’s because Kizaru is clearly not holding
back AT ALL even though we continue to get

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:29.909
brief flashbacks about all the memories he
has with Dr. Vegapunk.

00:01:29.909 --> 00:01:35.340
Which just makes him seem even more like a
pretty good dude who is friends with a lot

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:39.020
of these people like Sentomaru, Bonney, and
even Kuma.

00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:42.950
And at this point I am a bit worried that
this whole situation is going to end with

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:48.119
a truly heartbreaking moment where Kizaru
kills his longtime friend.

00:01:48.119 --> 00:01:52.969
Which I didn’t quite believe would actually
happen, but now that Oda is pulling at our

00:01:52.969 --> 00:01:59.539
heartstrings with all of these wholesome moments,
it seems like he is really setting us up for

00:01:59.539 --> 00:02:02.670
a tragic ending.

00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:08.239
Either that or maybe Kizaru will realize that
he doesn’t just have to blindly follow orders

00:02:08.239 --> 00:02:09.770
like a government slave.

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:16.459
Which is a pretty fitting parallel to Kuma
who was literally turned into a mindless government

00:02:16.459 --> 00:02:19.040
slave, but more on him in just a moment.

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:25.560
Because first we have to talk about how TRULY
INCREDIBLE Kizaru’s powers are.

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:32.019
I mean it’s always been a bit disappointing
that he doesn’t exactly move as fast as

00:02:32.019 --> 00:02:39.409
our real world light speed, but WOW this chapter
finally gave me some of the BREATHTAKING speed

00:02:39.409 --> 00:02:42.300
I’ve always wanted from him.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:49.580
Because when he zoomed away from Egghead only
to fly back in and ABSOLUTELY CRUSH Luffy,

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:52.830
my own eyes popped out of my head a bit.

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:58.490
Which makes this all the more impressive because
he did this to Snake Man Luffy, which is arguably

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:03.200
Luffy’s fastest form besides Gear 5.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:11.019
However, I’m not buying that Kizaru is stronger
than Luffy yet, because we’ve seen many

00:03:11.019 --> 00:03:17.440
times where a character looks super strong
for a chapter or two, only for them to get

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:21.050
completely wiped out a short time later.

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:26.580
Even the CP0 agent Lucci looked decent in
his fight against Luffy here on Egghead, but

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:31.659
then Luffy considered him no threat at all
just a short while later.

00:03:31.659 --> 00:03:36.720
And this is especially true at the end of
the chapter when we see giant Gear 5 Luffy

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:40.680
reach down and grab Kizaru like he was some
child’s toy.

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:47.260
So this fight definitely has a way to go,
unless of course it gets interrupted by oh

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:52.320
I don’t know a giant ancient robot or something…

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:54.150
Okay, come on!

00:03:54.150 --> 00:04:00.829
I have to be completely honest that when I
saw this thing waking up because of Luffy’s

00:04:00.829 --> 00:04:08.269
Gear 5 heartbeat, my mind instantly went into
super theory overdrive mode.

00:04:08.269 --> 00:04:10.080
We have Gear 5 Joy Boy.

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.550
The Drums of Liberation.

00:04:11.550 --> 00:04:14.950
This giant elephant that can also hear the
heartbeat.

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:17.109
The Eternal Flame.

00:04:17.109 --> 00:04:18.519
Roger.

00:04:18.519 --> 00:04:19.930
Shanks.

00:04:19.930 --> 00:04:21.459
The One Piece…

00:04:21.459 --> 00:04:24.530
Whew there’s so much!

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:28.820
But let’s slow down and actually break down
what we know.

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:38.289
First of all, in chapter 1067 we were told
that this armored giant was made over nine

00:04:38.289 --> 00:04:39.460
hundred years ago.

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:44.500
So clearly it is something from the technologically
advanced ancient kingdom.

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:50.240
Which makes me wonder, why exactly would it
wake up in response to Luffy’s heartbeat.

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:56.600
Well, unless this is just some sort of clever
trick, then the answer should clearly be that

00:04:56.600 --> 00:05:01.380
it can hear the Drums of Liberation just like
the ancient elephant Zunesha could when Luffy

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:02.860
first awakened.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:08.110
And now we obviously don’t know how this
is possible, but we should be able to assume

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:14.500
that somehow the Joy Boy who was alive during
the Void Century somehow made it so this thing

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.490
responded to his own heartbeat.

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:22.590
Which means now that Luffy also has that same
heartbeat when he enters Gear 5, this thing

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:28.690
is waking up to possibly fulfill its ancient
mission.

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:35.080
Unless of course it is waking up to attack
Luffy, which would be hilarious, but I highly

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:36.080
doubt it.

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:40.389
Though I can’t wait to see what crazy powers
it could have.

00:05:40.389 --> 00:05:45.400
Vegapunk also told us that this thing attacked
Mariejois two hundred years ago but then ran

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:47.940
out of power before it could finish its job.

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:53.860
Which actually brings up some super interesting
questions of where it came from, are there

00:05:53.860 --> 00:06:00.180
more of these things, and most importantly
how it awakened at all two hundred years ago.

00:06:00.180 --> 00:06:03.610
Was there another Joy Boy around that time?

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:07.610
Or did it have some other powersource?

00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:13.199
Speaking of power sources, this brings us
to another theory which actually got a lot

00:06:13.199 --> 00:06:20.860
more evidence in this chapter, which is that
Luffy’s Gear 5 awakening might be the so-called

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:25.440
Eternal Flame that the Lilith version of Vegapunk
mentioned in chapter 1065.

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:29.830
And in case you don’t remember this was
first introduced during a discussion about

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:33.960
fuel sources and Lilith saying she would love
to make her very own sun for energy.

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:36.580
Do you see how this is connected yet?

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:41.740
So basically somehow Luffy’s Gear 5 awakening
will allow him to use his devil fruit to somehow

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:42.900
create his own energy.

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:48.130
I mean, his devil fruit is named after the
ancient figure Nika who is often referred

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:49.520
to as the Sun God.

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:55.190
So I’m thinking now that Luffy will literally
make his own sun which can power all of the

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:56.500
ancient technology.

00:06:56.500 --> 00:07:00.370
Because keep in mind that the Vegapunks have
made a somewhat similar fuel source called

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:06.050
the Mother Flame, which was used to destroy
this entire island, but it is limited and

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:09.000
can only be made by Vegapunk on Egghead Island.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:15.500
However, there is still a lot that we don’t
know, and I also wonder why this giant robot

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:20.389
didn’t wake up when Luffy was using Gear
5 during his earlier fight with Lucci, but

00:07:20.389 --> 00:07:26.760
can you just imagine the possibility of Luffy
awakening a ton of ancient technology?

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:34.169
And speaking of that, this could also be one
of the first major clues for why Roger couldn’t

00:07:34.169 --> 00:07:37.599
use whatever he found on Laugh Tale all those
years ago.

00:07:37.599 --> 00:07:43.120
We know that his Vice-Captain Rayleigh said
they were too early to use what they found.

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:51.449
So perhaps they needed Joy Boy to awaken so
his heartbeat could awaken whatever is waiting

00:07:51.449 --> 00:07:52.740
on that island.

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:57.370
This makes even more sense when you consider
that it was only after Shanks saw that Luffy

00:07:57.370 --> 00:08:01.690
had awakened Gear 5 that he finally decided
to go after the one piece.

00:08:01.690 --> 00:08:07.430
So maybe Roger told him or he somehow figured
out that he needed someone to awaken Luffy’s

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:11.940
devil fruit before the One Piece treasure
could actually be used.

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:18.240
Which sounds kinda like Shanks is just using
Luffy, but hey, there’s already plenty of

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:24.900
Evil Shanks theories out there.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:31.020
Which brings us to the final world-shattering
part of the chapter where Kuma is going ABSOLUTELY

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:33.860
BERSERK in the Holy Land Mariejois.

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:36.770
And clearly he has some sort of mission here.

00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:41.080
Whether he was given orders by the leader
of the Revolutionary Army, Dragon, or by Dr.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:44.410
Vegapunk, we don’t really know.

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:51.850
Although it probably isn’t Dragon, since
he was so surprised in chapter 1067 when Kuma

00:08:51.850 --> 00:08:53.220
left the Revolutionaries.

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:57.990
And Vegapunk also doesn’t seem like he would
order him to cause destruction, so maybe it

00:08:57.990 --> 00:09:00.339
is his own last desire?

00:09:00.339 --> 00:09:05.040
Which means we have to ask what his actual
purpose is here.

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:10.140
It doesn’t seem like a big enough goal just
to kill some Celestial Dragons, so if we’re

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:16.000
thinking bigger could it be that his true
goal is to expose some of the secrets hidden

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:17.000
in Mariejois?

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:21.680
Specifically, I am talking about the secret
ruler of the world, Imu, or if there is some

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:24.660
other National Treasure hidden deep within
the castle.

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:27.970
Maybe something like a giant straw hat.

00:09:27.970 --> 00:09:31.760
And there is literally no better person for
this kind of mission than the man with the

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:42.660
OP devil fruit that can basically teleport
themself and other things.

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:47.060
So could this be the moment Imu is exposed?

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:53.220
And if it is, my goodness there is no perfect
person to actually witness this than the fleet

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:54.860
admiral Akainu himself.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:58.330
And can we just give this man a round of applause?

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:05.620
He finally got to leave his desk for the first
time since the timeskip, so good job Akainu.

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:10.040
But all jokes aside, this man still packs
a devastating punch.

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:18.360
He easily melts parts of Kuma’s body, although
he could not stop Kuma from getting away.

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:23.860
But besides the fighting, we need to ask why
did Oda choose this moment to bring Akainu

00:10:23.860 --> 00:10:24.910
out to play?

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:30.350
Because honestly, Akainu has always been one
of the most interesting characters in the

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:31.350
story.

00:10:31.350 --> 00:10:38.519
Clearly he has a strong sense of justice,
even if it is super extreme, but we have to

00:10:38.519 --> 00:10:45.880
ask what would he do if he learns that the
World Government he has always defended actually

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:49.089
turned out to just be a puppet all along?

00:10:49.089 --> 00:10:51.810
Would he just keep following orders?

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:54.970
Or would he turn against the Celestial Dragons
and Imu?

00:10:54.970 --> 00:11:01.630
I don’t really know, but there is no other
perfect time or situation for Akainu’s worldview

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:05.300
to be challenged.

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:10.700
Which means that very soon we could get the
simply MIND-BLOWING POSSIBILITY of Akainu

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:12.570
fighting against the world government.

00:11:12.570 --> 00:11:18.220
And this is such an INSANE idea that I actually
made an entire video explaining how Akainu’s

00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:24.829
journey would be if he was a pirate, which
you can watch right here.

00:11:24.829 --> 00:11:28.120
Shanks for watching and I’ll see you in
the next one.

